264:  \caption{\label{fig:reduction}Illustration of the reduction in the proof of Theorem~\ref{thm:approxdistanceishard}. Every vertex in the given Hamiltonian digraph $D$ (left) is replaced by the depicted gadget (right), yielding a maximum degree-three bipartite graph with a perfect matching.} 
