+| instance seed | factorizations to first verified witness | wall-clock seconds |
+|---:|---:|---:|
+| 100 | 97 | 0.334 |
+| 101 | 1,148 | 3.136 |
+| 102 | 43 | 0.127 |
+| 103 | 2,142 | 5.853 |
+| 104 | 625 | 1.725 |
+| 105 | 442 | 1.237 |
+| 106 | 334 | 1.012 |
